{"book":{"description":"It’s the day of the Minegahara Sports Festival! Kaede, Rio, and Yuuma are all on the blue team with Sakuta. That is, until he gets stuck filling in for a beach volleyball junior athlete named Minagi Ootsu—who’s nowhere to be found. The festival goes on with the Ball Toss and the Scavenger Hunt, and finally, Sakuta is free to eat lunch with Mai. On the way there, however, he happens upon Minagi in the last place he would have expected…\n\n[From [Yen Press](https://yenpress.com/titles/9798855434477-rascal-does-not-dream-of-a-beach-queen-light-novel)]","description_ja":"貴重な特典小説に書き下ろしをプラスした、ファン待望の『青ブタ』短編集！\n\nその日は峰ヶ原高校の体育祭。咲太はいつも通り、かえでに起こされ学校に向かう。理央や佑真と同じ青組で応援を決め込むも、憂鬱な相談が舞い込んで……。\n「玉入れのメンバーに欠員が出たから、咲太が出てくれ」\n　任されたのは、急に姿を消した同級生にしてビーチバレーのジュニア選手でもある大津美凪の代役。朋絵と玉入れをしたり、のどかと借り物競争に出たりして、ようやく訪れた麻衣とのお弁当タイム。\n　ところが、その途中立ち寄ったあるところで美凪の姿を発見し――!?\n　書き下ろし『トロピカルサマー』も収録する『青ブタ』初の短編集をお届け！\n\n[From [BookWalker](https://bookwalker.jp/defd390ca9-4e03-40fd-bd97-a27fb2210a06/)]","id":47136,"image_id":47609,"lang":"en","romaji":null,"romaji_orig":"Seishun Buta Yarou wa Beach Queen no Yume o Minai+","title":"Rascal Does Not Dream of a Beach Queen +","title_orig":"青春ブタ野郎はビーチクイーンの夢を見ない+","c_release_date":20250710,"c_release_dates":{"en":20260811,"ja":20250710,"zh-Hant":20260205},"olang":"ja","locked":false,"hidden":false,"image":{"id":47609,"width":220,"height":312,"spoiler":true,"nsfw":false,"filename":"xUJgJ0V2i98PwYrx.jpg"},"rating":{"score":7,"count":1},"num_reviews":{"count":0},"user_stats_score":[{"gs":10,"count":0},{"gs":9,"count":0},{"gs":8,"count":0},{"gs":7,"count":1},{"gs":6,"count":0},{"gs":5,"count":0},{"gs":4,"count":0},{"gs":3,"count":0},{"gs":2,"count":0},{"gs":1,"count":0}],"user_stats_label":[{"label_id":1,"count":2},{"label_id":2,"count":1},{"label_id":3,"count":8},{"label_id":6,"count":1}],"titles":[{"book_id":47136,"lang":"ja","official":true,"title":"青春ブタ野郎はビーチクイーンの夢を見ない+","romaji":"Seishun Buta Yarou wa Beach Queen no Yume o Minai+"},{"book_id":47136